| 配件采购单 | 件 | 3 | 3 | 0 | 3 | 2026-09-17T05:28:23+08:00 | 2026-11-12T18:00:00+08:00 | 未逾期\n(21 rows)", "id": "bba40a4522544708b161dbc1da5e9908", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:02:23.804717", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:02:23.806020", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "thinking", "thinking": "Good. Now let me get the stage_nodes for the partial order to explain the remaining 1 件 (外购 mode → procurement). Let me check procurement_lines for that order too.\n\nAlso note: the partial order SO20260814-0189 is 外购 mode, quantity 2 件, shipped 1, remaining 1, promised 2026-09-08, dispatched 2026-09-15 → 延期已发生 (7 days late at dispatch, and remaining 1 件 not yet shipped).\n\nLet me check its stage nodes and procurement.", "id": "cb31c505db194728bc2af7f398f9d30f", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:02:25.523912", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_414417858efa477c8b02f6c5", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"python3 datahub/scripts/query.py \\\"SELECT stage_code, stage_name, sequence, planned_end_at, actual_start_at, actual_end_at, stage_status FROM stage_nodes WHERE sales_order_id='SO20260814-0189' ORDER BY sequence\\\"\\necho \\\"--- procurement_lines ---\\\"\\npython3 datahub/scripts/query.py \\\"SELECT material_id, required_quantity, ordered_quantity, received_quantity, promised_at, arrived_at, supplier_id FROM procurement_lines WHERE sales_order_id='SO20260814-0189'\\\" 2>&1 | head -10\\necho \\\"--- 成品入库/销售出库 for this order ---\\\"\\npython3 datahub/scripts/query.py \\\"SELECT movement_type, signed_quantity, occurred_at, reference_id FROM wms_transactions WHERE sales_order_id='SO20260814-0189' ORDER BY occurred_at\\\"\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:02:27.650343", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_414417858efa477c8b02f6c5", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "stage_code | stage_name | sequence | planned_end_at | actual_start_at | actual_end_at | stage_status\n----------------------------------------\nPLAN | 计划 | 1 | 2026-08-16T04:00:00+08:00 | 2026-08-14T16:00:00+08:00 | 2026-08-16T08:56:43+08:00 | 已完成\nPROCESS | 采购备料 | 2 | 2026-08-23T22:48:00+08:00 | 2026-08-16T10:56:43+08:00 | 2026-08-23T07:22:46+08:00 | 已完成\nQC | 质检 | 3 | 2026-08-26T00:48:00+08:00 | 2026-08-23T09:22:46+08:00 | 2026-08-25T06:56:12+08:00 | 已完成\nSHIP | 发货 | 4 | 2026-08-27T02:48:00+08:00 | 2026-09-15T08:00:00+08:00 |  | 进行中\n(4 rows)\n--- procurement_lines ---\nSQL ERROR: no such column: received_quantity\n--- 成品入库/销售出库 for this order ---\nmovement_type | signed_quantity | occurred_at | reference_id\n----------------------------------------\n采购入库 | 2 | 2026-08-16T04:56:43+08:00 | PO-MO20260814-0189-1\n外购转成品 | -2 | 2026-08-16T12:56:43+08:00 | PO-MO20260814-0189-1\n成品入库 | 2 | 2026-08-25T07:56:12+08:00 | QC00192\n销售出库 | -1 | 2026-09-15T08:00:00+08:00 | SH-MO20260814-0189-1\n(4 rows)", "id": "7863151bac7e410282759b2b11c76201", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:02:30.026770", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:02:30.028592", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "thinking", "thinking": "Excellent — full evidence chain for the partial order:\n- 2 件 成品入库 (2026-08-25, QC00192)\n- 销售出库 -1 (2026-09-15, SH-MO20260814-0189-1)\n- 剩余 1 件 在成品库，SHIP 节点\"进行中\"，计划完成 2026-08-27，承诺交期 2026-09-08 → 延期已发生（快照 2026-09-18 已超承诺 10 天）\n\nSo the answer is clear. Let me also verify the 67 未发货 orders aren't relevant (they're 未发货, not 部分发货).\n\nNow let me write the answer. Conclusion first, with evidence SQL.\n\nAlso should I mention the adjacent interpretation (分批发货 44 单 all completed; 已全发未全签 21 单)? Yes, briefly, since \"部分发货\" is often confused.\n\nLet me also double check the 44 multi-batch orders — they're all fully received, so no partial shipment there. Good.\n\nOne more sanity check: are there any orders among the 67 未发货 that have partial 成品入库? Not needed for this question.\n\nLet me also confirm the strict SQL for the answer, and count of remaining quantity.\n\nI'll write the final answer now. Should I save an output file? Not required. Keep it concise.\n\nLet me produce the final answer with:\n1. 结论: 1 单 (SO20260814-0189)\n2. 口径\n3. 明细 + 证据链\n4. 全量分布表\n5. 相邻口径说明 (21 单已全发未全签, 44 单分批发货已全部签收)\n6. SQL\n\nTime window: 快照 2026-09-18 08:00 北京时间; 下单覆盖 2025-12 ~ 2026-09.\n\nUnits: 台/套/件/批 — the partial order is 件.\n\nLet me write it.", "id": "64d65fafd30041c88df59b9e527e970a", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:02:33.126997", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "text", "text": "## 结论\n\n**截至快照 2026-09-18 08:00（北京时间），769 笔已生效订单中，严格口径下的\"部分发货\"订单只有 1 笔：`SO20260814-0189`（工单 `MO20260814-0189`）。**\n\n## 口径\n\n按《业务口径要点.md》：*\"部分发货的剩余数量 = 订单数量 − 已发数量\"*，*\"订单完成 = 全量签收，分批发货按运单数量累计\"*。\n→ 判定条件：`0 < SUM(shipments.quantity) < orders.quantity`（已发 > 0 且未发完）。\n\n## 唯一命中订单明细\n\n| 字段 | 值 |\n|---|---|\n| 销售订单号 / 工单号 | **SO20260814-0189** / MO20260814-0189 |\n| 合同号 | KL20260814189 |\n| 客户 | 安徽鸿辰金瑞精细化工有限公司 |\n| 产品 / 单位 | 配件 / **件** |\n| 订单量 / 已发 / **剩余** | 2 / 1 / **1 件** |\n| 下单 → 承诺交期 | 2026-08-14 13:00 → **2026-09-08 18:00** |\n| 履约模式 / 交付依据 / 销售 | 外购 / 全量签收 / 黎文 |\n| 运单 | SH-MO20260814-0189-1，1 件，2026-09-15 08:00 发出，**在途未签收**（模拟物流3 / MOCK001881） |\n\n**证据链（同一订单跨表可追溯）**\n- `wms_transactions`：采购入库 +2（08-16）→ 外购转成品 −2 → 成品入库 +2（08-25，QC00192）→ **销售出库 −1（09-15，SH-MO20260814-0189-1）**，库里还压着 1 件成品未出库。\n- `stage_nodes`：计划/采购备料/质检 均已完成；**SHIP 发货节点 `stage_status=进行中`**，计划完成 2026-08-27，实际开始 2026-09-15，实际完成 NULL。\n- `logistics_events`：LE000686 已揽收（09-15 08:00）、LE000687 运输中（09-15 20:00），无签收事件。\n- ⚠️ **已发生的延期事实**（非预测）：承诺交期 09-08 已过 10 天，剩余 1 件仍未发出。\n\n## 全量分布（769 笔已生效订单）\n\n| 发货状态 | 订单数 | 订单量 | 已发量 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 未发货（无运单） | 67 | 156 | 0 |\n| **部分发货（已发<订单量）** | **1** | 2 | 1 |\n| 已全发、未全签（在途） | 21 | 57 | 57 |\n| 全量签收（完成） | 680 | 2171 | 2171 |\n\n数据一致性校验：`shipments` 与 `wms_transactions` 的\"销售出库\"按订单逐单核对，**702 笔有运单的订单全部金额/数量一致，0 笔不匹配**；无超发（shipped > quantity 为 0 笔）、无孤儿运单、单位全部与订单一致。\n\n## 容易混淆的相邻口径（都不是\"部分发货\"）\n\n- **分批发货 44 笔**（2 个运单）：累计已发量 = 订单量，且**已全部签收**，属于\"分批发货已完成\"，不算部分发货。\n- **已全发未全签 21 笔**：货全发出去了、签收没完成 → 是\"部分签收/在途\"，不是部分发货。其中 **7 笔已过承诺交期**（SO20260702-0176、SO20260728-0181、SO20260807-00562、SO20260808-00752、SO20260722-0179、SO20260812-00619、SO20260818-0183），同样是已发生的延期事实。\n\n## 原始 SQL\n\n```sql\nWITH shp AS (\n  SELECT sales_order_id, COUNT(*) batches, SUM(quantity) shipped,\n         SUM(CASE WHEN received_at IS NOT NULL THEN quantity ELSE 0 END) received\n  FROM shipments GROUP BY sales_order_id)\nSELECT o.sales_order_id, o.work_order_id, o.quantity, s.shipped,\n       o.quantity - s.shipped AS remaining, o.unit, o.promised_delivery_at\nFROM orders o JOIN shp s USING(sales_order_id)\nWHERE o.is_effective = 1 AND s.shipped > 0 AND s.shipped < o.quantity;\n```\n\n时间窗口：下单覆盖 2025-12 ~ 2026-09，观测截止 2026-09-18 08:00；单位按 台/套/件/批 分列，未跨单位折算。\n\n⟦ 部分发货订单查询｜已完成：严格口径(0<已发<订单量)仅1单 SO20260814-0189（配件2件/已发1/剩1，承诺09-08已逾期10天，SHIP节点进行中）；shipments与WMS销售出库702单逐单一致｜锚点：SO20260814-0189、SH-MO20260814-0189-1、已全发未全签21单、分批发货44单已全部签收 ⟧", "id": "7bbbda7810c74b84846f8fc44d5ee706", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:02:38.873188", "finished_at": null}], "role": "assistant", "id": "ecc8818140f24d19875dd425f64c54e0", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_turn_usage": {"usage": {"provider_id": "chinaunion", "model_name": "qwen3.8-flash", "prompt_tokens": 378232, "completion_tokens": 8221, "total_tokens": 386453, "cache_read_tokens": 352640, "cache_write_tokens": 0, "cache_eligible_input_tokens": 378232, "cache_observed": true, "cache_hit_rate": 93.23378244040694, "context_size": 1000000, "compact_threshold": 0.8, "session_cache_read_tokens": 352640, "session_cache_eligible_input_tokens": 378232, "session_cache_observed": true, "session_cache_hit_rate": 93.23378244040694}, "context_usage": {"estimated_tokens": 14237, "max_input_length": 1000000, "context_usage_ratio": 1.4237}}}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:00:35.701699", "usage": {"input_tokens": 378232, "output_tokens": 8221, "cache_input_tokens": 352640, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0}, "finished_at": "2026-09-17T23:02:54.531312", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}], "reply_context": {"reply_id": "ecc8818140f24d19875dd425f64c54e0", "cur_iter": 19, "structured_schema": null, "structured_output": null}, "permission_context": {"mode": "bypass", "working_directories": {}, "allow_rules": {}, "deny_rules": {}, "ask_rules": {}}, "tool_context": {"max_cache_files": 100, "max_cache_bytes": 25000.0, "read_file_cache": [], "activated_groups": []}, "tasks_context": {"tasks": []}, "middle_context": {"qwenpaw_auto_memory_turn_state": {"pending": ["4e7210c71def48e38047bb0fd4d8eb0b"], "seen": {"4e7210c71def48e38047bb0fd4d8eb0b": null}, "snapshots": {}, "search": {"turn_marker": "4e7210c71def48e38047bb0fd4d8eb0b", "messages": []}, "version": 2}}}, "scroll": {"persisted_ids": ["4e7210c71def48e38047bb0fd4d8eb0b", "ecc8818140f24d19875dd425f64c54e0"], "persisted_tcids": ["call_162da787394d46f3b95c9768", "call_37fbead54686470193701c66", "call_3f66abc0c81348a7ac57e518", "call_414417858efa477c8b02f6c5", "call_54a26f8e6c9b4e37b9e53e61", "call_56b67331d4224eeda5f05ba5", "call_5aa966a3fe5a4a4f8352dcee", "call_649209741bd54d3491c7e7d1", "call_7404b3fd896740289dc591b8", "call_7a263734c9b8441cb361df14", "call_7dcf4eae01ea48919e1ee290", "call_8136c12d28274dbfbfb9df75", "call_950858dfae7848a59b80873a", "call_96e3f67267884074a68a4d43", "call_ac4ab8d9269f4efd9e49bd0b", "call_ad365f3b137a44bdaa2fbe19", "call_b70c3f6b977a4e98bffd9efd", "call_c6b5da67901c4540a4a6ec2f", "call_d098c314bcc64cffad538a12", "call_e67de365df834f959d3a1552"], "seen_tool_result_ids": ["call_162da787394d46f3b95c9768", "call_37fbead54686470193701c66", "call_3f66abc0c81348a7ac57e518", "call_414417858efa477c8b02f6c5", "call_54a26f8e6c9b4e37b9e53e61", "call_56b67331d4224eeda5f05ba5", "call_5aa966a3fe5a4a4f8352dcee", "call_649209741bd54d3491c7e7d1", "call_7404b3fd896740289dc591b8", "call_7a263734c9b8441cb361df14